WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:08.232
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> <b>Part 2</b>

2
00:00:12.872 --> 00:00:16.031
Mrs Myers turned over the first card.

3
00:00:17.854 --> 00:00:23.252
‘The seven of diamonds. That means money. You’re going to be rich!

4
00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:30.058
And the jack of hearts! That’s a lovely card.

5
00:00:30.383 --> 00:00:33.073
It means you’re going to meet a young man.’

6
00:00:33.921 --> 00:00:37.785
‘Ah,’ said Mrs McCleary. ‘And what next?’

7
00:00:39.933 --> 00:00:45.222
‘The ten of spades,’ said Mrs Myers, as she turned over the third card.

8
00:00:45.403 --> 00:00:53.635
‘That means you’re going to travel. But then,’ she exclaimed,

9
00:00:53.671 --> 00:00:59.303
‘we’ve got the king of clubs! Clubs always mean problems.

10
00:00:59.448 --> 00:01:04.106
Somebody’s going to try to stop you. An old man…’

11
00:01:04.394 --> 00:01:07.662
‘Probably my father!’ Mrs McCleary exclaimed.

12
00:01:07.824 --> 00:01:11.977
‘But let’s look at the last card,’ said Mrs Myers.

13
00:01:14.973 --> 00:01:20.227
‘The queen of hearts! You’re going to fall in love with a young man.

14
00:01:20.642 --> 00:01:27.015
Dear Miss Jones, in one year’s time you’re going to marry a very rich young man,

15
00:01:27.033 --> 00:01:29.921
a businessman – he travels a lot.

16
00:01:30.661 --> 00:01:37.070
An old man is going to try to stop your marriage, but he’s not going to succeed.

17
00:01:37.648 --> 00:01:41.998
You’re going to move far away from here, probably abroad.

18
00:01:42.757 --> 00:01:45.320
That will be one pound, please.’

19
00:01:45.771 --> 00:01:49.003
‘Thank you so much,’ said Mrs McCleary.

20
00:01:49.238 --> 00:01:53.462
She took a pound from her purse and gave it to Mrs Myers.

21
00:01:53.985 --> 00:01:56.567
‘Thank you,’ said Mrs Myers.

22
00:01:56.639 --> 00:02:01.225
‘Goodbye, my dear Miss Jones…Next please!’

23
00:02:08.662 --> 00:02:13.139
When Mrs McCleary got home, she told her husband everything.

24
00:02:13.428 --> 00:02:17.996
‘I don’t like it,’ Inspector McCleary said. ‘What shall we do about her?

25
00:02:18.321 --> 00:02:20.812
I know! I’ll report her.’

26
00:02:21.642 --> 00:02:24.459
And that’s what Inspector McCleary did.